      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NUTS THEN BOLTS (3) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (23.25) at this track behind Hollies Hayley in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Key chance in this line up. MAXIMUM GAYLE (2) turned spotting a big start finishing sixth (23.10) last time in a Grade 5 at Bulli. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Has the ability to give this a shake. SWIFT EDDY (8) is a promising dog in the frame at four of nine starts including two wins and was in the minors again latest (23.35) over 400m at this track. Looks suited and expected to run well. JAMATI GIRL (6) was in the money again last time and not beaten far when third (23.44) at this track in a Grade 5.",
